@startuml
title HDFS 小文件治理闭环

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #334155
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  FontColor #0F172A
}

rectangle "发现\n按表 / 分区统计新增文件、大小分布、读取频率" as observe #E0F2FE
rectangle "归因\n路径映射到调度实例、写入组件与并行度" as trace #DBEAFE
rectangle "止增\n调整分区粒度、输出并行度与滚动策略" as stop #FEF3C7
rectangle "存量处理" as remedy {
  rectangle "表数据\n用计算任务重写到 staging" as rewrite #F8FAFC
  rectangle "特定普通文件\n满足限制时使用 concat" as concat #F8FAFC
  rectangle "冷且只读\n创建 HAR 后单独验证" as har #F8FAFC
}
rectangle "校验\n记录数、关键聚合、格式可读、文件数" as verify #DCFCE7
rectangle "切换与观察\nrename 正式路径，保留原目录回滚窗口" as swap #DCFCE7

observe -down-> trace
trace -down-> stop
stop -down-> rewrite
stop -down-> concat
stop -down-> har
rewrite -down-> verify
concat -down-> verify
har -down-> verify
verify -down-> swap
swap .up.> observe : 持续复查新增量

note right of stop
  先停止继续制造，
  再清理历史存量
end note

note right of swap
  验证通过后才删除备份；
  每一步都要能回滚
end note
@enduml
